        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A. The term Faculty Committee shall mean an Advisory Committee of not less than three (3) nor more than eleven (11) teachers elected by the teachers of that worksite. The Faculty Committee shall be elected by secret ballot election, conducted by the CTA Faculty Representative.",
            "block_bbox": [
                45,
                742,
