                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. The Faculty Committee may meet during the regular duty day at such times as committee members have no student contact. The Faculty Committee may meet with other teachers and may meet as a group without the principal, during the regular duty day at such times as committee members or the teachers have no student contact provided that such meetings shall not conflict with previously scheduled meetings.",
